                <pb facs="0388" n="1846" sameAs="frus:frus1951v07p2/pg1846"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>For the texts of statements made on November 13 by Secretary of State Acheson and
                    Ambassador Warren E. Austin at the meeting of the United Nations General
                    Assembly in Paris, opposing a Soviet proposal <pb facs="0389" n="1847"
                        xml:id="pg1847"/> to include in the agenda an item on Chinese
                    representation, see the Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, December 3, 1951, page 917. The General Assembly rejected
                    the Soviet proposal later that day.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
